      "writtenOn": "2026-10-02T12:58:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a follow-up to my comment on 125823 [PceGraph.java:93](https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/transportpce/+/125823/comment/255b5283_b2975195) about clearing `pathElementList`. In step1, `setPathElementList` used `addAll`, which copied the list. `addPathElementListToMap` now stores the list itself, so every k key points to the same list.\n\nAs a result, clearing it with `pathElementList.clear()` would also empty the entries already stored for earlier k-paths. I suggest assigning a new list in `isPathHybrid` instead, or storing a copy here:\n\n```\npcdpa.addPathElementListToMap(kpathorder, List.copyOf(pathElementList));\n```",
      "revId": "905d8c753d07892543a8dec6354f68b09b7ef12f",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
