      "writtenOn": "2026-10-02T12:58:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nothing ever writes to the `pathElementMap` field (line 99). Line 283 only fills the aggregator\u0027s own map. `prunePathElementMap` therefore always gets an empty map, the size check at line 331 fails, and the method returns `false` before any TAPI path computation starts.\n\nI suggest either filling the local map at line 283 or reading the map from the aggregator.",
      "revId": "905d8c753d07892543a8dec6354f68b09b7ef12f",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
