    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "89d6f0b6_5d519293",
        "filename": "pce/src/main/java/org/opendaylight/transportpce/pce/graph/PceGraph.java",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 337,
      "author": {
        "id": 9231
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-02T12:58:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The loop expects the pruned keys to be 0..kpathOrderMax-1 with no gaps, but `prunedKorderList` can be any subset. For example, if k-paths {1, 2} remain, `pathElementMap.get(0)` at line 340 returns null and the for-each throws an NPE.\n\nAlso, if no `TapiSbi` element is found, `nporder` ends up equal to the list size, and `getSubGraphPathFromMap(...).orElseThrow()` throws `NoSuchElementException`.\n\nI suggest iterating over `pathElementMap.entrySet()` and skipping (or logging) a path that has no TAPI element.",
      "revId": "905d8c753d07892543a8dec6354f68b09b7ef12f",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
