      "writtenOn": "2026-10-02T12:58:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`new PceResult()` defaults to `RESPONSE_FAILED`. The check at PceGraph.java:247 is therefore always false, and every second-step path hits `continue`. It also overwrites the result of `papv.checkPath` from PceGraph.java:235, so a real validation failure is lost as well.\n\nUntil `calculateE2Emargin` is implemented, I suggest passing in the `PceResult` from `papv.checkPath` and returning it.",
      "revId": "905d8c753d07892543a8dec6354f68b09b7ef12f",
