      "message": "This listener is never registered. `ServiceHandlerProvider` registers the composite listeners of the other handlers, but not this one. As a result, `SecondStepHybridPcResult` is never handled and `setIs2ndStepFinished(true)` (line 192) is never reached.\n\nAlso, nothing calls `setInput()`. So even once it\u0027s registered, `serviceInputMap` is empty and the method returns at line 117.",
