      "writtenOn": "2026-10-02T12:58:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are two NPEs here:\n\n- The orchestrator publishes an empty `AggregatedPathDescription` (`PceCrossDomainPathAggregator.aggPathDescription`), so `getCdServicePathDescription()` at line 125 returns null.\n- Per the YANG model, the per-path `cross-domain-service` is only present `when cross-domain \u003d true`, and the service list lives in the notification\u0027s top-level `cross-domain-service`. So `entry.getValue().getCrossDomainService()` is null here.\n\nI suggest reading the services from `secondStepHybridPcResult.getCrossDomainService()` and using `nonnullCdServicePathDescription()`.",
      "revId": "905d8c753d07892543a8dec6354f68b09b7ef12f",
